      "@type": "VisualMaterial",
      "instance_name": "child1",
      "label": "Black child",
      "description": "A young Black child wearing a patterned hat and a thick, textured coat, sitting in a wooden cart and smiling broadly. The child's joyful expression is prominent, and their clothing suggests cold weather. This child is the central figure on the left side of the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
